 "stem": "Find the range of values for the constant $m$ for which the quadratic equation $x^2-2mx+2m^2-3m=0$ has real solutions. Mark the interval for $m$ and set each end hollow or filled.",
 "solution": [
  "Real solutions means $D\\ge0$.",
